WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.493
One report, written for every donor.

2
00:00:03.845 --> 00:00:07.051
With Storyraise personalization, each
reader sees their own name, their own

3
00:00:07.061 --> 00:00:09.803
giving, and the story that fits them.

4
00:00:09.813 --> 00:00:11.951
It starts on the Constituents tab.

5
00:00:11.961 --> 00:00:16.920
Choose Add constituents, then upload a CSV
file, or connect your CRM so your records

6
00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:18.726
stay in sync.

7
00:00:18.813 --> 00:00:21.810
Your file needs First Name, Last Name, and
Email.

8
00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:26.117
Every other column, like Donor Level or
Gift Amount, comes in as a custom field.

9
00:00:26.127 --> 00:00:29.398
Map your columns, then Import
constituents.

10
00:00:30.013 --> 00:00:32.273
Open anyone to see their profile.

11
00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:37.022
Each field is a variable, like donor
level, ready to drop into a report.

12
00:00:38.013 --> 00:00:42.496
In the report, type a variable right into
your text, between double at signs.

13
00:00:42.506 --> 00:00:46.176
Dear first name becomes Dear Emily, with
her own gift and giving level filled in

14
00:00:46.186 --> 00:00:47.605
too.

15
00:00:47.615 --> 00:00:51.506
To show a section to some donors only,
select it and open Use Data.

16
00:00:51.516 --> 00:00:55.546
Under Show When, pick donor level, is,
Gold.

17
00:00:55.556 --> 00:00:59.732
Silver and Bronze get their own sections,
set up the same way.

18
00:01:00.415 --> 00:01:03.813
Open web preview and choose who you are
previewing as.

19
00:01:04.026 --> 00:01:07.905
Emily Wilson is a Bronze donor, so she
sees her name and the Bronze story.

20
00:01:07.915 --> 00:01:11.882
Switch to James Taylor, and the same
report turns Gold.

21
00:01:13.415 --> 00:01:14.520
Ready to send?

22
00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:16.825
Publish your report, then open Share.

23
00:01:16.921 --> 00:01:19.860
Tell us which email platform you use, and
Get report link.

24
00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:24.557
Your platform fills in each donor's email,
so everyone opens their own report.

25
00:01:25.015 --> 00:01:26.730
Or let us send it for you.

26
00:01:27.082 --> 00:01:31.089
Storyraise Send drafts the email, with a
personalized View the Report button.

27
00:01:31.099 --> 00:01:36.435
Pick your recipients, like the donors you
just imported, then schedule it and send.

28
00:01:37.015 --> 00:01:41.661
Upload your donors, add a few variables,
and every reader gets a report that feels

29
00:01:41.671 --> 00:01:43.095
written for them.
